  "goodToKnow": "Gütig means kind or benevolent, a slightly old-fashioned, warm word: ein gütiger Großvater, gütig lächeln. Zu gütig! (too kind) is often ironic. Die Güte is kindness or quality: Du meine Güte! (my goodness), eine Einigung in Güte (amicable settlement). Gütlich means amicable. Synonyms: gutherzig, wohlwollend. The opposite is boshaft."
